doartworks","id":18700548,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NzAwNTQ4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18700548?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/edoartworks","html_url":"https://github.com/edoartworks","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edoartworks/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edoartworks/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edoartworks/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edoartworks/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edoartworks/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edoartworks/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edoartworks/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edoartworks/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edoartworks/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-12T15:02:15Z","updated_at":"2025-04-12T21:13:03Z","body":"EDIT: I opened a new issue https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105328 \n\n---\nHey, I'm just trying to implement this on 4.4.1 and having trouble :( Maybe I'm missing something?\n\nI simply want to open the FileDialog (native) to select a .txt file. \nSo my app shouldn't need full file access permission, right? [According to google's documentation...](https://developer.android.com/training/data-storage/shared/documents-files)\n\nSo okay, without permissions, _file_selected_ signal correctly triggers on files selected from a few folders like Download and Documents, but not others. And that's fine.\nBut then, when I use the path from _file_selected_, to load the file using this code:\n`FileAccess.open(file_path, FileAccess.READ)`\n\nI get **ERROR 7: ERR_FILE_NOT_FOUND**\n\nThe only way FileAccess works, is by enabling MANAGE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE permission, which I really want to avoid doing!\nI also tried MANAGE_DOCUMENTS permission, with the same result.\n\nI tested this using the test project above.\n\nAm I missing something?\n@syntaxerror247 @ArtinGaming \n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2798864906/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]